1
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:03,400
你在拍吗
Are you getting this?

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,480
我在拍
I'm getting the shot.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,020
但我搞不懂你在做什么
I'm just not getting what you're trying to do.

4
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:09,220
我们可是在澳大利亚 地球的底端啊
We're in Australia -- it's on the bottom of the globe,

5
00:00:09,220 --> 00:00:11,325
所以除了我 所有人都是上下颠倒的
so everyone here but me is upside-down.

6
00:00:11,354 --> 00:00:12,020
地理知识
It's geography.

7
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,400
现在正好可以告诉你
It's a good time to tell you --

8
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,100
卢克一岁时 我把他头朝下掉地上了
I dropped Luke on his head when he was 1.

9
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:16,540
好吧 我也来
Okay, I'm up.

10
00:00:17,784 --> 00:00:19,219
你也把他掉地上了吗
Did you drop him, too?

11
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,580
帮我拉下腿 伙计
Grab my leg, buddy.

12
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,890
走着
Here we go.

13
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,720
我来自"下面"那片土地
I come from the land down under.

14
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,200
他不是的
He doesn't.

15
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:28,120
我父母在澳洲度蜜月时怀上我的
I was conceived in Australia on my parents' honeymoon.

16
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:31,220
那是个浪漫的仲夏之夜 是那边的夏天
It was a romantic summer night -- their summer --

17
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:33,060
在公园里的一条毯子上
on a blanket in the park.

18
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,220
我现在还留着那条毯子
I still have that blanket.

19
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,960
菲尔的妈妈留给我们一笔钱去那里旅游
Phil's mom left us money for a trip there,

20
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,560
家里其他人知道后
and when the rest of the family found out,

21
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,920
都要跟着一起来
they all just jumped on board.

22
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,720
我妈的外公是澳大利亚人
My mom's grandfather was Australian,

23
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,880
她每年夏天
and she'd spend her summers

24
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:45,020
也就是那里的冬天 都会去看望他
-- their winters -- visiting him.

25
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:47,060
对她而言那是个特别的地方
It was a very special place for her.

26
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,840
她一直希望我去看看
She always wanted me to see it.

27
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:50,498
等等 你还留着那条毯子吗
Wait -- you still have that blanket?

28
00:00:50,498 --> 00:00:52,343
是啊 傻瓜 就是我们床上那条
Yeah, silly. It's the one on our bed.

29
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,020
你确定不要来点维吉麦酱吗 歌洛莉亚
You sure you don't want some of this vegemite, Gloria?

30
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:56,900
你会错过美味的
You don't know what you're missing.

31
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:59,610
不知道里面有什么我是不会吃的
Ay, I don't eat anything unless I know what's in it.

32
00:00:59,621 --> 00:01:02,623
我看过这女人狼吞虎咽地吃猪鼻子
I've seen this woman scarf down a pig's nose.

33
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:05,800
有时候 人得穿过大半个地球
Sometimes, one must travel halfway across the globe

34
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:07,840
才能看清家的模样
to get the clearest view of home.

35
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,200
一路上都这样
This was my whole flight.

36
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,300
她在说什么
What's she talking about?

37
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,740
我的大学申请论文
My college-application essay.

38
00:01:11,880 --> 00:01:13,320
他们喜欢成熟有阅历的学生
They want students who are worldly.

39
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:15,020
你何不写我们的夏威夷之行呢
Oh, why don't you write about our trip to Hawaii

40
00:01:15,020 --> 00:01:17,000
你还直接捧着椰子喝呢
when you drank straight from a coconut?

41
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:17,920
我觉得哈佛会收到很多
I feel like Harvard's gonna get

42
00:01:17,929 --> 00:01:19,200
那样的论文 所以
a lot of those, so...

43
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,740
各位 我要感激有幸成为
Hey, guys, I just wanted to say thanks

44
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:24,720
这场庄严的澳大利亚朝拜之行的一员
for being a part of this pilgrimage to majestic Australia,

45
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:25,900
这里曾是罪犯的流放地
which was once a penal colony.

46
00:01:26,641 --> 00:01:27,900
成熟一点
Grow up.

47
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:30,080
这里对我妈妈真的很特别
This place was really special to my mom.

48
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:31,820
她其实给我留了一张
She actually left me a list of things

49
00:01:31,820 --> 00:01:33,580
她觉得我们该做的事情清单
that she thought we should do --

50
00:01:33,580 --> 00:01:35,240
去大堡礁游玩
Visit the great Barrier Reef,

51
00:01:35,240 --> 00:01:36,180
去看丛林
See the bush...

52
00:01:36,880 --> 00:01:37,320
真要这样吗
Really?

53
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:40,132
还有爬悉尼海港大桥
...and climb the Sydney Harbour Bridge.

54
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:43,640
你们觉得怎么样 伙伴们
what do you say, mates?

55
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,800
抱歉 亲爱的
I'm sorry, honey,

56
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,580
但你也知道我有恐高症的
but you know how I am with heights.

57
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:49,475
所以你才从不穿高跟鞋吗
Ah. Is that why you never wear high heels?

58
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,020
你们都愿意一起来的吧
You guys are with me, right?

59
00:01:51,020 --> 00:01:53,200
-当然不 -不 我才不去
- Absolutely not. - Nah, I'm not doing that.

60
00:01:53,200 --> 00:01:54,000
-真的吗 -不去
- Really? - No.

61
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,220
不必担心
No worries.

62
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:56,120
这句是澳大利亚英语
That's Australian.

63
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:58,720
我...有必要的话我自己来
I'll, uh, I'll do that one on my own if I have to.

64
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,280
我只是很激动我们能一起来这里
I'm just so excited we're all here together.

65
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:02,660
-其实我们得走了 -对啊 所以
- Actually, we have to go. - Yeah, so...

66
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:04,720
以前我们认识个来自澳大利亚的家伙
Back in the day, we knew this guy from Australia.

67
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:05,880
-是新西兰 -都一样啦
- New Zealand. - Same thing.

68
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:08,980
他没什么朋友 于是我们很同情他
He didn't have a lot of friends, and we felt sorry for him,

69
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:11,040
但其实他有点惹人烦
but the truth is, he was kind of annoying.

70
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:13,120
他总是很兴奋地说个不停
He was one of those guys that was always on.

71
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,740
后来他的签证过期 让我们松了口气
Big relief when his visa ran out.

72
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:16,260
总之 我并没有错
Anyway, through no fault of my own --

73
00:02:16,260 --> 00:02:16,600
等等 不 等等
Wait, no, wait --

74
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:17,900
你在Facebook上发布说
you announced on Facebook

75
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:20,220
我们要去澳大利亚 而他就住在那里
that we were going to Australia, which is where he lives.

76
00:02:20,220 --> 00:02:22,740
费格斯邀请我们吃午饭 我无法拒绝
Fergus invited us to lunch. I couldn't say no.

77
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:23,780
换我就会拒绝
I could have said no.

78
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:25,480
所以你的Facebook只有12个好友
Which is why you have 12 friends on Facebook.

79
00:02:27,009 --> 00:02:28,960
克莱尔 亲爱的 我得告诉你
Claire, honey, I got to tell you,

80
00:02:28,960 --> 00:02:31,280
汉诺威那单生意你真的干得太漂亮了
you really knocked it out of the park on the Hanover deal.

81
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,920
拜托 老爸 都是你的功劳啦
Oh, come on, dad. That was all you.

82
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:33,860
不 是你的功劳
No, it was you.

83
00:02:33,860 --> 00:02:34,078
不 是你啦
No, it was you!

84
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,680
是你 是你的宝贝项目
It was you. It was your baby.

85
00:02:37,260 --> 00:02:39,100
一路上都这样
This was my whole flight.

86
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:43,400
克莱尔第一次在公司带头做项目
Claire took the lead on her first project at the company

87
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:45,200
干得很漂亮
and scored a big one.

88
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:49,540
最棒的是 她打败了那个来自
Best part is, she beat out that arrogant gasbag Earl Norton

89
00:02:49,540 --> 00:02:52,460
橱柜橱柜橱柜橱柜公司的傲慢话唠厄尔
over at Closets, Closets, Closets, Closets.

90
00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:54,140
我真希望我能看到
I wish I could see the look

91
00:02:54,140 --> 00:02:56,520
他那张蠢脸上的表情表情表情表情
on his stupid face, face, face, face.

92
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,160
先干什么呢
So, what's first?

93
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:02,400
我想曼尼想去歌剧院
I think Manny wants to see the Opera House.

94
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,200
坐了那么长时间的飞机
Actually, it was a long flight.

95
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:06,900
我想我们要不去邦戴海滩上走走好了
I was thinking maybe just... Hang out on Bondi beach.

96
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:08,480
好主意 曼尼
That's a great idea, Manny.

97
00:03:09,180 --> 00:03:10,860
邦戴海滩上都是光着上身的美女
Bondi beach is topless.

98
00:03:10,871 --> 00:03:12,910
感谢到到网的介绍
Thank you, TripAdvisor.

99
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,780
那就去海滩吧
Beach it is.

100
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:17,260
开始我们的澳洲派对吧
Let's get this Aussie party started!

101
00:03:17,500 --> 00:03:18,780
天啊 你的嘴怎么了
Oh, my god. What's wrong with your mouth?

102
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:20,568
你的嘴唇好厚
Ay! Your lips are huge!

103
00:03:20,578 --> 00:03:23,000
我觉得你是对维吉麦酱过敏了
I think you're allergic to the ve-he-mi-te.

104
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,540
别担心
No worries.

105
00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:25,120
我会有点担心的
I'd be a little worried.

106
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:48,440
我妈说乔很好
My mom said that Joe is fine,

107
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:51,580
他吃了睡 睡醒了起来又继续吃
he ate, he slept, he woke up, and then he ate again.

108
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:53,060
真是乔的一贯作风
Classic Joe.

109
00:03:53,840 --> 00:03:56,200
卢克和我要去躲躲太阳
So, uh, Luke and I are gonna take a break from the sun.

110
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,820
是啊 我们有点累了[受够了]
Yeah. We're kind of tired.

111
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:59,380
受够了没看见咪咪
Tired of not seeing boobs.

112
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:04,440
看着当地人从土地中获得食物
Watching the natives take nourishment from their land

113
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:07,020
让我清楚地认识到
has made me acutely aware of the fact

114
00:04:07,020 --> 00:04:08,860
我现在只是在叽里呱啦而已
that I am just saying words now.

115
00:04:08,860 --> 00:04:09,700
我到底怎么了
What is wrong with me?

116
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,860
完全没思路[被挡住]
I'm totally blocked.

117
00:04:10,860 --> 00:04:13,120
我也是 过去点
So am I. Scooch.

118
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,780
你好吗
How's it going?

119
00:04:19,325 --> 00:04:20,380
你怎么这么冷淡
Why weren't you all over that?

120
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:21,500
他帅呆了
He's totally gorgeous.

121
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:24,680
这个国家的第一大出口商品就是冲浪帅哥
This country's number-one export is hot surfers.

122
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,400
我才不要和第一个看见的人去玩
I'm not gonna buy the first one I see.

123
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:27,260
我要挑一挑
I'm still browsing.

124
00:04:28,292 --> 00:04:30,940
瞧 袋鼠 我要买一只
Ooh! Kangaroos! I'm going to buy one.

125
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:32,540
莉莉 我刚才怎么说的
Lily, what did I just say?

126
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,700
我不知道 可能和鞋子有关吧
I don't know. Something about shoes, probably?

127
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:37,220
你爸爸只给了你买一件纪念品的钱
Your dad gave you enough money for one souvenir.

128
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:38,620
不要买你第一个看到的东西
Don't buy the first thing you see.

129
00:04:38,620 --> 00:04:40,200
不然整个旅程你都会后悔的
You'll regret it your whole trip.

130
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,280
你说得对
You're right.

131
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,620
我已经够后悔了
I have enough regret.

132
00:04:45,765 --> 00:04:47,117
这不是真的吧
You got to be kidding me.

133
00:04:47,589 --> 00:04:48,700
有人出价比我们低
We got outbid!

134
00:04:48,700 --> 00:04:49,720
什么 是谁
What? By whom?

135
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:51,180
我让你猜四次
I'll give you four guesses.

136
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:51,840
该死
Damn it.

137
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:52,720
等等
Wait a second.

138
00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:55,880
他们给我们48小时来提交新报价
They're giving us 48 hours to submit a new bid.

139
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:57,160
我们能做到
We can do that.

140
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:58,340
我们绝对能做到
We can totally do that.

141
00:04:58,340 --> 00:04:59,773
我们回酒店去做新报价
Let's go back to the hotel and figure it out.

142
00:04:59,773 --> 00:05:00,480
不能等等嘛
Can it wait?

143
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,320
是啊 我们在度假呢
Yeah, we're on vacation.

144
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:02,960
抱歉 各位 我们必须要去
Oh, sorry, guys. We have to do this.

145
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:04,240
这是我的宝贝项目
This is my baby.

146
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:04,943
杰
Jay.

147
00:05:04,943 --> 00:05:06,400
-爸爸 -克莱尔
- Dad! - Claire.

148
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:06,840
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

149
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,320
好吧 你俩回去工作
Fine! You two go back to work.

150
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:11,040
菲尔和我要去海里
Phil and I, we're going to walk to the ocean,

151
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,860
没了你们 我们会玩得更开心
and we're going to have more fun without you.

152
00:05:12,860 --> 00:05:13,820
是的
Yeah, we will.

153
00:05:14,020 --> 00:05:15,260
不 不会 完全不会
No, we won't. Not at all.

154
00:05:15,300 --> 00:05:16,540
你们为什么要那样说
Why would you guys even say that?

155
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,480
坐在那儿40分钟后
So, after sitting there for 40 minutes,

156
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,280
我告诉女服务员
I tell the waitress,

157
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:22,580
我其实很赶时间
"I'm actually in a hurry.

158
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:23,720
有没有可能在鸡蛋孵出小鸡前
Any chance of getting the eggs

159
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,020
给我上鸡蛋啊
before they turn into chickens?"

160
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,800
她简直是个饭桶
You know? And she's a total bogan.

161
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,760
她说 我要应付五桌客人呢
She's like, "I've got five tables!"

162
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:31,060
知道他们是怎么送托盘的吗
You know how they have the tray?

163
00:05:31,060 --> 00:05:32,800
她这样舞步滑动
She's sashaying with the legs.

164
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,240
华夫饼是谁的
"Oh, who's got the waffles?!

165
00:05:34,250 --> 00:05:36,330
华夫饼是谁的
Who-- who's got the waffles?!"

166
00:05:36,340 --> 00:05:38,020
好了 我们明白 我们明白
All right, we get it. We get it.

167
00:05:38,020 --> 00:05:38,700
人们在看呢
People are looking.

168
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,380
我没法阻止人们看我
Oh, nothing I can do to stop that.

169
00:05:40,380 --> 00:05:41,860
我能想到一个办法
Well, I can think of one thing.

170
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:44,460
-费格斯 跟你聊天真愉快 -是啊
- Well, listen, Fergus, it has been great catching up, - Yes.

171
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:47,060
但我们今天得和家人一起度过
but we really have to spend some time with our family today.

172
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,693
打扰了 安德森先生
I'm -- I'm so sorry. Um, Mr. Anderson?

173
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:50,520
我们是铁杆粉
We are huge fans.

174
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,760
能和您合影吗
Could we get a picture?

175
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:52,600
当然可以 来吧
Of course. Come on.

176
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,260
过来
Bring it in.

177
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:55,100
坐在这里 就这样
Sit down there. There you go.

178
00:05:55,100 --> 00:05:55,740
我不会起来的
I won't get up.

179
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:56,740
怎么回事
What's happening?

180
00:05:56,780 --> 00:05:57,760
我不知道 查查他
I don't know. Google him.

181
00:05:57,770 --> 00:05:59,620
我没有国际流量包
I didn't spring for an international data plan.

182
00:05:59,620 --> 00:06:00,560
非常感谢
Thank you so much.

183
00:06:00,560 --> 00:06:02,000
你喜欢吗 好吧
You like that? All right.

184
00:06:02,126 --> 00:06:02,873
天啊
Oh, my god!

185
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:04,920
记得以前你们楼下
Hey, remember your old downstairs neighbor

186
00:06:04,920 --> 00:06:06,480
可以把整个拳头塞进嘴里的邻居吗
that could put his entire fist in his mouth?

187
00:06:07,753 --> 00:06:08,634
小卡
Cam.

188
00:06:08,634 --> 00:06:09,232
我觉得我的拳头变大了
I think my fist got bigger.

189
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,580
等等 费格斯
Wait. Fergus,

190
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:13,100
你有自己的节目吗
you have your own show?

191
00:06:14,320 --> 00:06:16,180
是啊 只是个小小的脱口秀啦
Yeah. It's just a little talk show.

192
00:06:16,180 --> 00:06:17,020
不算什么
No big deal.

193
00:06:17,220 --> 00:06:18,580
我想在这里算件大事吧
It's a big deal here, I suppose,

194
00:06:18,580 --> 00:06:19,380
是啊
but yeah.

195
00:06:19,380 --> 00:06:21,040
真可惜你们这就要走了
It's a shame you guys have got to leave so soon.

196
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,700
那什么
Oh, well, you know,

197
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:23,500
我们可以再待一会儿
we could stay for a little bit longer.

198
00:06:23,500 --> 00:06:24,665
-是啊 是啊 -没关系
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. - That's fine.

199
00:06:24,665 --> 00:06:25,811
你还没说完那个女服务员的事呢
You never finished the story about the waitress and the...

200
00:06:25,811 --> 00:06:26,806
没错 那个...
Yeah, with the...

201
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:28,849
谁点的华夫饼
"Who had the waffles?!"

202
00:06:29,951 --> 00:06:31,420
-华夫饼 -华夫饼
- Waffles?! - Waffles?!

203
00:06:33,400 --> 00:06:35,420
克莱尔和杰错过了
I just feel bad that Claire and Jay

204
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:38,060
这个绝美的国家 同时也是一块大陆的
are missing such a beautiful day in this gorgeous country,

205
00:06:38,060 --> 00:06:39,620
美妙一天真是太不幸了
which is also a continent.

206
00:06:39,620 --> 00:06:41,243
你知道的可真多
You have a lot of facts.

207
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:45,760
我觉得你的这次精神之旅真是太赞了
I think this spiritual journey of yours is a wonderful thing.

208
00:06:45,860 --> 00:06:48,020
这会让你离你母亲更近一点
I think it's gonna make you feel closer to your mother.

209
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:49,000
希望如此吧
I hope so.

210
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,000
我很想她
I miss her.

211
00:06:50,438 --> 00:06:52,849
这就是我来这儿的主要原因 亲近母亲
It's the biggest reason I came here -- to connect.

212
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:53,880
很怪吗
Is that weird?

213
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:54,860
一点都不
Not at all.

214
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:57,660
我就经常跟我已故的外婆沟通
I talk to my late grandmother all the time.

215
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,200
她会喜欢这个地方的
She would have loved this place.

216
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,940
或许她现在就在我的身边
I wonder if she's here with me now.

217
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:05,100
不会 她讨厌坐飞机
No, she doesn't like to fly.

218
00:07:05,686 --> 00:07:08,334
我的父母在同一片海滩上留下了
Isn't it wild that my mom and dad made footprints

219
00:07:08,549 --> 00:07:09,311
爱情的足迹真是...
in this very sa-- aah!

220
00:07:09,311 --> 00:07:10,317
怎么了
What?!

221
00:07:10,317 --> 00:07:11,519
有东西在咬我
Something bit me!

222
00:07:13,023 --> 00:07:14,782
水母
Jellyfish!

223
00:07:25,528 --> 00:07:26,300
搞什么
What is this?

224
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:27,680
一个露乳的女人都没有
Not one topless woman.

225
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,580
淡定点
Calm down.

226
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:30,200
你会把咪咪吓跑的
You're gonna spook the boobs.

227
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,997
等等 两点钟方向
Uh, wait -- 2:00.

228
00:07:40,378 --> 00:07:41,529
卢克
Hey, Luke!

229
00:07:42,024 --> 00:07:43,680
卢克 水有多深
Luke! How deep is it?!

230
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:45,600
别乱吼 显得我们跟白痴似的
Be cool! We don't want to look like idiots!

231
00:07:50,140 --> 00:07:52,140
我的泳裤被冲走了
I lost my bathing suit!

232
00:07:52,140 --> 00:07:53,700
曼尼 帮我找到它
Manny, help me find it!

233
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:56,120
我没带鼻塞
I don't have my nose plug!

234
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,200
小男孩 你还好吗
Little boy, are you okay?

235
00:07:58,607 --> 00:08:00,110
曼尼 说句话啊
Manny, say something!

236
00:08:00,168 --> 00:08:03,260
小姐 小姐 他的泳裤被冲走了
Miss! Miss! He lost his bathing suit!

237
00:08:03,260 --> 00:08:06,120
宝贝 我来帮你找 没事的
Oh, honey, I can help you find it. It's okay.

238
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:06,740
我很好
I'm fine!

239
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,600
水很清的
The water's really clear.

240
00:08:11,580 --> 00:08:13,400
我爱死你的豪车了
I love your limo!

241
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:15,760
你不觉得这有点儿高调吗
You don't think it draws too much attention to me?

242
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:17,300
说什么鬼话呢
What are you talking abo-o-o-o-o-ut?!

243
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:18,340
才没有
No.

244
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,640
最后我们跟费格斯在一起
We ended up spending a little more time with Fergus

245
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,380
又多待了一会儿
than we planned.

246
00:08:22,380 --> 00:08:24,680
说实话 这给我们上了一课
Which, honestly, felt like growth to us,

247
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,011
-没错 -因为我觉得
- Yes. - Because I think

248
00:08:26,100 --> 00:08:29,000
有时我们还没了解别人就乱下定论
sometimes we judge people before we get to know them.

249
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,460
难以相信他们竟然让你进来
I cannot believe they let us in here.

250
00:08:32,460 --> 00:08:34,040
你到底有多出名
How famous are you?

251
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,080
有时我觉得我才是供人观赏的动物
Well, sometimes, I feel like I'm the one in the zoo.

252
00:08:36,960 --> 00:08:38,620
我跟这考拉唯一的区别
Only difference between me and this guy

253
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:39,720
就是我不会尿在你身上
is I won't pee on you.

254
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,661
对吧
Right?

255
00:08:42,100 --> 00:08:43,680
说真的 它们会尿在你身上
Seriously, they will pee on you.

256
00:08:43,680 --> 00:08:43,988
真的吗 它会尿在我们身上
Oh, for real? He will pee on us?

257
00:08:43,988 --> 00:08:44,320
-好吧 -真的吗
- Okay. - Is that so?

258
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:47,300
结果发现 我们有很多共同点
Turns out, we have a lot in common.

259
00:08:47,300 --> 00:08:50,120
比如我们都不喜欢排队
For example, we all hate standing in lines.

260
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,043
记得把照片发我一份噢
Make sure I get copies of those.

261
00:08:51,055 --> 00:08:51,797
他是不是很幽默
Isn't he funny?

262
00:08:51,881 --> 00:08:52,360
我们跟他是一起的 所以我们就先
We're with him, so we're just gonna...

263
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:52,912
快来 你们先进
Come on. Through you go.

264
00:08:52,912 --> 00:08:53,804
对不住 费格斯总是这样
Sorry. Classic Fergus,

265
00:08:53,804 --> 00:08:54,709
带我们直接进来
getting us in like this.

266
00:08:55,104 --> 00:08:55,667
小卡
Cam.

267
00:08:57,800 --> 00:09:04,180
下一家礼品店在哪里
Where's the next gift shop?

268
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:06,060
继续逛礼品店我会疯的 莉莉
I cannot look at another souvenir, Lily.

269
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,220
都是因为你
You did this.

270
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:07,920
莉莉 放轻松
Lily, relax.

271
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:08,920
你会找到完美的纪念品的
You'll find the perfect one.

272
00:09:09,560 --> 00:09:11,060
我也想相信你
I want to believe you,

273
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:14,140
但刚才那个救生员真的是帅到爆棚
but that lifeguard was the cutest boy I've ever seen.

274
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,360
我知道
I know.

275
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,560
你们好
Hey, guys!

276
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:17,980
在商务中心找到了他们
Found 'em in the business center.

277
00:09:17,980 --> 00:09:20,180
快点走 我们还要赶去丛林的车呢
Come on. We got to catch the bus to the bush.

278
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:21,540
你们什么时候醒来的
What time did you wake up?

279
00:09:21,540 --> 00:09:24,230
凌晨五点 克莱尔的职业道德感很强
5:00 A.M. Claire has an incredible work ethic.

280
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,440
她跟我年轻时一模一样
She's like a young me.

281
00:09:26,042 --> 00:09:28,475
杨蜜是我们来自韩国的会计
Yung-mi was our accountant from Korea.

282
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,460
操劳过度而死
Died at her desk.

283
00:09:29,900 --> 00:09:31,120
好了 别再谈工作了
Okay, enough work.

284
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,060
-该享受我们的假期了 -没错
- It's time to enjoy our vacation. - Yeah.

285
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:34,317
知道了 我们只需再弄一下...
Yeah, we just got to finish up a few quick, little thi--

286
00:09:34,317 --> 00:09:35,367
不行 工作结束
No, you're done.

287
00:09:35,367 --> 00:09:36,840
-好吧 不工作了 -我们走吧
- Done. We're done. - Let's go.

288
00:09:37,115 --> 00:09:39,197
杰 我很想你
Jay, I miss you.

289
00:09:39,344 --> 00:09:42,260
而且我一人已经保护不了菲尔了
And besides, I don't know that I can keep Phil safe anymore.

290
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,360
我觉得他会死在这里
I think he's going to die here.

291
00:09:46,620 --> 00:09:47,560
是费格斯的短信
Oh, it's Fergus.

292
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,260
什么 他为什么只给你发短信
What? Why did he text you and not me?

293
00:09:49,260 --> 00:09:51,640
他邀请我们去休·杰克曼的游艇派对
He invited us to a party today on Hugh Jackman's yacht.

294
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,300
什么 今天吗 不要啊
What?! Not today! No!

295
00:09:53,300 --> 00:09:54,466
我想见休·杰克曼
I want to meet Hugh Jackman!

296
00:09:54,466 --> 00:09:55,653
我也是 我也是
I do, too. I do, too.

297
00:09:55,663 --> 00:09:57,459
但我们不能再放家人的鸽子了
But, you know, w-we can't bail on my family again.

298
00:09:57,459 --> 00:09:59,781
这样我们就真的成脑残粉了
That makes us complete star you-know-what-ers.

299
00:09:59,781 --> 00:10:01,640
再说了 小卡 这也会很有意思的
Plus, Cam, this will be fun, too.

300
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:03,460
每个人都带了防晒霜和防虫剂吧
Everybody have their sunscreen and bug spray?

301
00:10:03,460 --> 00:10:04,957
我带了蛇咬伤急救包
I got the snakebite kit.

302
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:09,260
各位 我们有个坏消息
Hey, guys, we just got some really bad news.

303
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:10,400
是啊 所以
Yeah, so...

304
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:19,120
行走于澳大利亚人祖先曾走过的小径
Walking the paths once trod by the first Australians

305
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,120
让我变得 怎样呢
has made me...what?

306
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,140
难以忍受
Unbearable?

307
00:10:22,209 --> 00:10:23,420
幸运的话
Now, if we're lucky,

308
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:26,400
我们会见到一些著名的澳大利亚本地物种
we'll see some of Australia's more famous indigenous species --

309
00:10:26,400 --> 00:10:28,520
袋鼠 澳洲野狗 考拉
kangaroo, dingoes, koala.

310
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,300
问个问题
Quick question.

311
00:10:29,300 --> 00:10:30,240
很好 又一个问题
Oh, good -- another one.

312
00:10:30,327 --> 00:10:33,200
那些小袋鼠 或者说幼兽出生的时候
Isn't it true that baby kangaroos, or -- or joeys,

313
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:34,460
真的没有后腿吗
are born without hind legs?

314
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:35,220
是的
Yes.

315
00:10:35,220 --> 00:10:37,280
你又一次正确回答了自己的问题
Once again, you've correctly answered your own question.

316
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:39,920
刚收到橱柜橱柜橱柜公司的厄尔的短信
I just got a text from earl at Closets, Closets, Closets --

317
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:40,578
我知道那公司叫什么 老爸
I know what it's called, dad.

318
00:10:40,578 --> 00:10:43,251
听听 "祝你下次好运 哈哈"
Listen to this -- "Better luck next time. Ha ha."

319
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:45,880
他总是知道说什么来激怒我
He always knows what to say to get my goat.

320
00:10:45,900 --> 00:10:47,760
我在等木材供应商给我报价
I'm waiting for a quote from the lumber supplier,

321
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,580
可这次徒步要3个小时 手机会没信号
but this hike is three hours -- I'm gonna lose signal.

322
00:10:49,580 --> 00:10:50,460
我们回去吧
Let's go back.

323
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:53,419
老爸 我们必须找个靠谱的借口
Dad, we can't just up and leave without a plausible reason wh--

324
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,560
克莱尔受伤了
Claire's hurt!

325
00:10:56,620 --> 00:10:57,500
怎么了
What happened?

326
00:10:57,510 --> 00:10:59,100
你知道她总是笨手笨脚的
Well, you know what a klutz she is.

327
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:00,100
亲爱的 你还好吧
Honey, are you okay?

328
00:11:00,100 --> 00:11:01,000
不太好
Not really.

329
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,440
我来带她回营地吧
Yeah, well, I -- let me get her back to camp.

330
00:11:02,440 --> 00:11:03,340
我们只会拖慢你们的速度
We're just gonna slow you down.

331
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:05,020
-来吧 乖女儿 -你们玩得开心
- Come on, sweetheart. -Yeah, you guys have fun.

332
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:08,880
他们是觉得我们有多白痴
How dumb do they think we are?

333
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:10,600
有时克莱尔会留给我食物的图片
Sometimes, claire leaves me pictures of food

334
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,640
而不是文字的购物清单
instead of a shopping list.

335
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,760
我好紧张
I'm so nervous.

336
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,700
我们真能看到穿泳装的休·杰克曼吗
Are we gonna see Hugh Jackman in a bathing suit?

337
00:11:16,900 --> 00:11:18,680
我们要对穿泳装的休·杰克曼说什么呢
What do we say to hugh jackman in a bathing suit?

338
00:11:18,940 --> 00:11:20,260
天啊 好"大"
Oh, my god. It's so big.

339
00:11:20,260 --> 00:11:22,249
太直接了吧 不过他说不定会很开心
That's a bit direct, but, you know, he might be flattered.

340
00:11:22,260 --> 00:11:23,620
原来你是在说那艘船
Oh, you're talking about the boat.

341
00:11:23,675 --> 00:11:24,367
费格斯
Fergus!

342
00:11:24,367 --> 00:11:25,400
费格斯
Fergus!

343
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:27,340
感谢上帝你们来了
Oh, guys. Thank god you're here.

344
00:11:27,900 --> 00:11:29,520
我刚刚和休大吵了一架
Just had the worst fight with Hugh.

345
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:30,480
不是吧 怎么了
Oh, no. What happened?

346
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:32,660
我取笑《悲惨世界》里的罗素·克洛来着
I took a shot at Russell Crowe in "Les Mis."

347
00:11:32,660 --> 00:11:33,740
结果休生气了
Hugh took offense.

348
00:11:33,740 --> 00:11:35,240
他应该知道那角色
Oh, well, he has to know

349
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,202
-不该让罗素来演吧 -他必须知道
- Russell was horribly miscast. - He has to know.

350
00:11:36,202 --> 00:11:36,960
绝对是选角失误
Horribly miscasted.

351
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:38,440
-不是他的错 -不是他的错
- It's not his fault. - It's not his fault.

352
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:39,800
他表演得还行 但是...
He was -- the acting was fine, but --

353
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:41,500
我们上船去把事情说清楚
Okay, let's get on this boat and fix this.

354
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:41,996
对 把一切说清楚
Yep. Fix it.Come on.

355
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,360
不是这条船
That's not the boat.

356
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,340
他们已经走了
They've already gone.

357
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:47,780
休穿着条暴露的泳裤站在甲板上
Hugh was standing on his deck in a skimpy, little bathing suit,

358
00:11:47,780 --> 00:11:49,160
看起来很失望
disappointed look on his face.

359
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:51,480
慢着 我没听错吧 暴露的泳裤吗
Wait. I'm s-- wait. Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Skimpy?

360
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,860
不好意思 站在他的什么上
I'm sorry -- standing on his what?

361
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:53,520
他的甲板上
On his deck.

362
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,620
船上的甲板 了解
Of the boat. Got it. Okay.

363
00:11:55,620 --> 00:11:56,800
知道吗
You know what?

364
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,280
我们不需要他们
We don't need them.

365
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,980
我去雇条船 我们可以自己开派对
I'll hire a boat. We'll have our own party!

366
00:12:02,016 --> 00:12:03,284
这才是生活 是吧
This is the life, eh, boys?

367
00:12:03,284 --> 00:12:05,733
所以我们不是开这个去坐大船吗
Oh, s-- so we're not taking this to a bigger boat?

368
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:07,800
一条大船
A bigger boat!

369
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:08,980
来块鲜肉派吧
Have a meat pie.

370
00:12:08,980 --> 00:12:10,700
不了 谢谢 不要
No, thank you. No.

371
00:12:11,030 --> 00:12:12,010
不用 谢谢
No, thanks.

372
00:12:14,024 --> 00:12:15,013
你还好吧 菲尔
Are you okay, Phil?

373
00:12:15,013 --> 00:12:16,020
我没事
Yeah, yeah, I'm fine.

374
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:18,140
我只是希望克莱尔能在这里
I just wish Claire was here to see all this.

375
00:12:18,736 --> 00:12:20,489
而且我的脚已经肿成两倍大了
Plus, my foot's twice its normal size,

376
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,800
蚊子还追着我被水母咬过的地方叮
and the mosquitoes are really going after my jellyfish bites.

377
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:25,760
看哪 一个征兆
Look! A sign!

378
00:12:28,340 --> 00:12:28,780
什么
What?

379
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:32,280
你想看袋鼠 现在就看到了
You wanted to see a kangaroo, and now you see one.

380
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:34,420
我想这是你妈妈在告诉你
I think this is your mother trying to tell you

381
00:12:34,420 --> 00:12:37,440
接下来旅途会变得很棒 菲尔
that the rest of the trip is going to be magical, Phil.

382
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,091
我妈就是这种人
That is so my mom,

383
00:12:38,091 --> 00:12:39,846
用袋鼠来传递讯息
to say it with a kangaroo.

384
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,760
看
Look.

385
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:42,620
太美了
So beautiful.

386
00:12:42,660 --> 00:12:44,580
小心点 你会吓着它的
Okay, but be careful. You're gonna scare him.

387
00:12:45,896 --> 00:12:47,172
亲 你好
G'day, mate.

388
00:12:48,053 --> 00:12:52,099
你会不会...
Hey, aren't you gor--

389
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,480
这个
This one.

390
00:13:02,480 --> 00:13:04,060
不 这个
No, this one!

391
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:04,980
不 这个
No, this one!

392
00:13:04,980 --> 00:13:05,980
我快喘不过气了
I can't breathe!

393
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:09,180
跟莉莉一起买东西绝对是最好的避孕措施
Shopping with Lily is the best birth control in the world.

394
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:10,180
没错
Yeah.

395
00:13:10,740 --> 00:13:13,360
但你知道这没有实际效果的吧
But you know it's not, right?

396
00:13:14,214 --> 00:13:15,252
这个
Ooh! This one!

397
00:13:15,340 --> 00:13:17,100
感谢上帝 快点买吧
Thank god. Hurry up and buy it.

398
00:13:17,955 --> 00:13:20,245
等等 如果之后我们碰到更好的怎么办
Wait. What if there's a better one later?

399
00:13:20,300 --> 00:13:20,940
我们继续逛吧
Let's keep looking.

400
00:13:21,140 --> 00:13:22,640
不不不 你就买这个
No, no, no! You are buying that.

401
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,860
你不可能找到更好的了
You're never gonna find anything better.

402
00:13:23,860 --> 00:13:25,500
我就没找到更帅的救生员
I never found a hotter lifeguard, okay?

403
00:13:25,500 --> 00:13:27,460
这个很完美 而且就在你面前
This is perfect, and it is right in front of you.

404
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:28,940
给 谢谢
Here. Thanks.

405
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:31,760
我很喜欢你的口音
I really love your accent.

406
00:13:32,580 --> 00:13:33,500
谢谢
Wow. Thank you.

407
00:13:36,080 --> 00:13:38,220
我要退掉这个
I would like to return this.

408
00:13:41,380 --> 00:13:42,820
想什么呢
Penny for your thoughts?

409
00:13:43,460 --> 00:13:43,900
咪咪
Boobs.

410
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:44,760
我也是
Me too!

411
00:13:44,760 --> 00:13:46,060
我们到底怎么了
What's our problem?

412
00:13:46,400 --> 00:13:48,040
那东西扑面而来的时候我就慌了
I freaked out when those things came at us.

413
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,197
我以为我能承受一个
I think I could've handled one,

414
00:13:49,208 --> 00:13:50,690
但是它们一起来了
but they ganged up on me.

415
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:51,980
小伙子们
Hey, boys.

416
00:13:51,980 --> 00:13:53,660
想不想参与一次
How would you like to participate

417
00:13:53,660 --> 00:13:54,920
原住民徒步之旅
in an aboriginal walkabout?

418
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,700
不了 谢谢 你问问那些女孩吧
No, thanks. Why don't you ask those girls over there?

419
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,200
这次徒步只限男士参与
This walkabout's for men only.

420
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,640
相信我 我们算不上男士
Trust me -- we're not men.

421
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:02,420
看来你真的很需要这个经历
Sounds like you need this more than anyone.

422
00:14:02,420 --> 00:14:03,340
快点 来吧
Quick -- come here.

423
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,180
真好 现在我们还化妆了
Perfect. Now we're wearing makeup.

424
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:12,520
你是在开玩笑吧
You have got to be kidding me.

425
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:14,340
我们可以走到丛林去吗
Okay, can we walk to the bush?

426
00:14:14,340 --> 00:14:16,420
不行 调配中心会在1小时内派来新车
Nah. Dispatch is sending a cab in an hour.

427
00:14:16,420 --> 00:14:17,520
-1小时 -搞什么
- An hour. - What?!

428
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,300
小卡 是我们活该
No, Cam, we deserve this.

429
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:22,020
我们抛弃了家庭 丢开了女儿
We deserted our family, we abandoned our daughter,

430
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:22,700
为了什么呢
and for what?

431
00:14:23,616 --> 00:14:24,774
我们不仅是脑残粉
We're not just star you-know-what-ers.

432
00:14:24,774 --> 00:14:26,340
而且还是大傻叉
We're you-know-what-holes!

433
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:27,820
你知道莉莉不在这儿你可以说脏话吧
You know Lily's not here, right?

434
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:31,720
我的天哪
Oh, my god.

435
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:40,420
镇定一点
Please be cool.

436
00:14:40,420 --> 00:14:42,160
我一向很镇定
I'm always cool.

437
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:43,420
你们好
Hello!

438
00:14:44,960 --> 00:14:47,300
鞋子不错啊
There's some pretty fancy shoes.

439
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,800
谢谢
Thank you...?

440
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,740
听我说 我们不想惹麻烦
So, listen, we don't want any trouble,

441
00:14:51,740 --> 00:14:54,360
但是 我和我朋友
uh, but my -- my friend and I --

442
00:14:54,360 --> 00:14:55,260
朋友 真的吗
"Friend"? Really?

443
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:56,340
是的
Yeah.

444
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,600
我们的车坏了
Our cab broke down,

445
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:00,660
我们要去找我们的女儿
and we are trying to get to our daughter --

446
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:03,320
我和我朋友共同的女儿
The daughter my friend and I have together.

447
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:06,620
这是不对的
Well, that ain't right.

448
00:15:08,039 --> 00:15:10,232
爸爸们应该和女儿在一起
Daddies should be with their little girls.

449
00:15:12,180 --> 00:15:14,140
说真的 这鞋子我能在哪买到
Seriously, where can I get a pair of them shoes?

450
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:15,480
他想要你的鞋 快给他
He wants your shoes. Give him your shoes.

451
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:16,227
什么 好吧
What? All right.

452
00:15:16,227 --> 00:15:17,617
我不想要你的 我想要自己的
I don't want your shoes. I want to get me own.

453
00:15:17,617 --> 00:15:19,521
他不想要你的鞋 快穿上
He doesn't want your shoes. Put your shoes on.

454
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:25,320
我就知道
I knew it!

455
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:26,400
歌洛莉亚 别生气
Gloria, don't be mad.

456
00:15:26,400 --> 00:15:26,920
太迟了
Too late!

457
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:27,980
我知道这看起来很糟
I know this looks really bad,

458
00:15:27,990 --> 00:15:29,860
但你必须要明白这是我
but you have to understand that this is my --

459
00:15:29,860 --> 00:15:31,800
你的宝贝项目是吧 我知道
Your baby?! I know.

460
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:33,880
你们应该感到羞耻
And you should be ashamed of yourself!

461
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:36,500
你的丈夫正在进行精神之旅
You have a husband who is on a spiritual journey

462
00:15:36,500 --> 00:15:38,200
还被袋鼠揍了一拳
and was punched by a kangaroo!

463
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:39,400
什么
What?!

464
00:15:40,400 --> 00:15:40,880
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

465
00:15:42,200 --> 00:15:43,740
亲爱的 我刚听说
Honey, I just heard.

466
00:15:43,740 --> 00:15:46,080
你怎么被袋鼠给打了呢
How did you get punched by a kangaroo?

467
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,120
很猛的一下
Really hard.

468
00:15:47,120 --> 00:15:48,240
在脸上
In the face.

469
00:15:48,240 --> 00:15:49,700
我很抱歉
Oh. I'm sorry.

470
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:50,900
天哪
Oh, boy.

471
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:52,600
我能帮你做点什么吗
Is there anything I can do?

472
00:15:52,940 --> 00:15:54,640
你能别工作了陪我坐一下吗
Could you stop working and sit with me for a while?

473
00:15:54,702 --> 00:15:56,212
-当然可以了 -谢谢
- Yes, of course I can. - Thank you.

474
00:15:56,212 --> 00:15:57,762
好的 温柔点
Okay. Be -- be soft.

475
00:15:57,773 --> 00:15:59,634
谢谢你 宝贝
Okay. Thank you. Aw, baby.

476
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,400
天哪 菲尔
Oh, my god. Phil.

477
00:16:03,741 --> 00:16:04,625
亲爱的
Honey!

478
00:16:05,780 --> 00:16:08,820
菲尔 一只野狗抢了我的电脑
Phil! A wild dog took my laptop!

479
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:09,940
看来它真的以为那是你的"宝贝"
Seems like a missed opportunity.

480
00:16:10,540 --> 00:16:12,980
亲爱的 如果你想工作就直说吧
Honey, if you want to work, just say so.

481
00:16:12,980 --> 00:16:14,860
不是 真的发生了 发生了
No! It happened! It just happened!

482
00:16:15,000 --> 00:16:15,920
我什么也没看见
I didn't see anything.

483
00:16:15,920 --> 00:16:17,780
我没看到你被袋鼠揍
I didn't see you get hit in the face by a kangaroo,

484
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:18,500
但我相信你了
but I believe you.

485
00:16:18,500 --> 00:16:19,700
快点 帮我抢回来
Come on! Help me get it!

486
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:22,320
不 你自己去吧
No! You're on your own!

487
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:24,540
就像我独自旅行一样
Like I've been this whole trip!

488
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:28,420
我的天哪
For god's sakes!

489
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:31,040
歌洛莉亚 别走 听我解释
Gloria, stop! Let me explain!

490
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,160
好吧 但你最好别跟我解释说
Fine -- but the explanation better not be

491
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:35,520
这是个很重要的客户 而且你要赶进度
that this is an important account and you're on a deadline

492
00:16:35,520 --> 00:16:36,520
什么什么什么的
and blah, blah, blah, blah, blah!

493
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:39,140
好吧 那我需要一分钟想一想
Oh. Well, I'm gonna need a minute to think.

494
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:42,400
我丢下乔 漂洋过海
I did not leave Joe, fly across the world,

495
00:16:42,400 --> 00:16:44,440
不是为了来看你工作的
to see you spend all your time working!

496
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,940
你这样完全不是在度假
You're missing the whole vacation!

497
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:48,280
你不是第一个这么说我的妻子
Not the first wife to tell me that.

498
00:16:48,280 --> 00:16:51,400
那你还要多少个妻子说才能听进去
So how many wives need to say it before you listen?

499
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:56,900
那是怎么回事
What's that?

500
00:16:57,580 --> 00:16:58,920
我不会告诉你的
I'm not gonna tell you.

501
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:01,400
要是你之前在这里的话 你就知道了
If you were here, you would know what that is.

502
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:03,980
我也不知道那是怎么回事
I don't know what that was.

503
00:17:03,980 --> 00:17:06,560
但我就是不想让他得意
But I was not going to give him the satisfaction.

504
00:17:17,742 --> 00:17:18,809
该死
Damn it!

505
00:17:19,940 --> 00:17:21,400
为什么 澳大利亚 为什么
Why, Australia?! Why?!

506
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,100
你好 伙计
Hey, mate.

507
00:17:24,100 --> 00:17:25,180
怎么样
How's...it going?!

508
00:17:25,180 --> 00:17:26,740
一切都还好吗
Everything okay here?

509
00:17:26,740 --> 00:17:27,921
不太好
Not really.

510
00:17:28,560 --> 00:17:30,360
恕我直言 你看起来有点狼狈
You don't mind me saying, you look a bit beaten up.

511
00:17:30,460 --> 00:17:31,020
是的
Yeah.

512
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,840
我爱你的祖国
I love your country,

513
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:34,280
但是你的祖国并不爱我
but your country doesn't love me back.

514
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:38,120
澳大利亚讨厌我
Australia's rejected me.

515
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:39,680
你看到这里没有
You see this right here?

516
00:17:40,620 --> 00:17:42,360
这是鳄鱼咬的
That's from a croc bite.

517
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:44,660
我后背上这个
This one here on my back --

518
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:47,480
是我在墨尔本被煤车撞的
I was hit by a tram in Melbourne.

519
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:49,480
这里这个...
This right here --

520
00:17:49,859 --> 00:17:50,974
这个痣不正常
That's an irregular mole.

521
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:53,440
得去好好检查一下
Should probably get that checked out.

522
00:17:54,280 --> 00:17:57,500
我要说的是 澳大利亚对游客是友善的
Point is -- Australia is nice to tourists,

523
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:00,500
但她对自己的人民却是苛刻的
but it's tough on its own people.

524
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,920
恭喜你 伙计
Congratulations, mate.

525
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:03,080
你是我们的一员
You're one of us.

526
00:18:03,080 --> 00:18:04,540
你说的和我想的是一样的吗
Are you saying what I think you're saying?

527
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:05,560
我想是的
I think I am.

528
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:07,000
我是鳄鱼·邓菲
I'm Crocodile Dunphy?

529
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:09,520
这...和我说的还真不沾边儿
That's...not what I was saying at all.

530
00:18:09,747 --> 00:18:12,464
那是笑翠鸟吗 天生看不见东西的
Is that a kookaburra, which are born blind, or --

531
00:18:15,669 --> 00:18:16,764
妈妈
Mom?

532
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:22,760
你在这里啊
There you are.

533
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:25,080
爸 笔记本丢了
Dad, the laptop is gone.

534
00:18:25,160 --> 00:18:26,920
我们得马上回酒店
We've got to get back to the hotel right now.

535
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:27,840
我还清楚记得里面的内容
It's still fresh in my mind.

536
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:29,600
我想我能再把内容凑齐
I think I can just piece it together --

537
00:18:29,600 --> 00:18:29,920
克莱尔
Claire.

538
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:31,340
随它去吧
Let it go.

539
00:18:31,340 --> 00:18:32,740
什么 不行
What? No!

540
00:18:32,740 --> 00:18:34,480
我倾注了我的心血在里面
I-I poured my heart into this.

541
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,260
难道你不想气一气厄尔吗
And don't you want to stick it to Earl?

542
00:18:36,260 --> 00:18:36,900
都无所谓
Doesn't matter.

543
00:18:37,360 --> 00:18:39,220
和你的家人在一起吧
Go be with your family.

544
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:40,900
还记得你小时候吗
Remember when you were a kid?

545
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,502
我们全家出去旅行
We'd take the family trips?

546
00:18:42,531 --> 00:18:44,350
然后我消失了好几天去工作
I'd disappear for days to work.

547
00:18:45,260 --> 00:18:47,540
别和我一样
Don't be me.

548
00:18:49,780 --> 00:18:51,340
我觉得我让你失望了
I feel like I'm letting you down.

549
00:18:51,340 --> 00:18:52,500
你说什么呢
What are you talking about?

550
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:55,380
我总算有点时间和我女儿一起度假了
I finally get to spend a little vacation time with my daughter.

551
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:57,640
是啊
Yeah.

552
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:02,760
那是什么
What is that?

553
00:19:04,724 --> 00:19:05,739
莉莉 我们来了
Lily! We're here!

554
00:19:05,739 --> 00:19:07,073
大爸二爸爱你
Daddies love you!

555
00:19:07,073 --> 00:19:07,985
大爸二爸
Daddies!

556
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:12,280
我的天
Oh, my gosh!

557
00:19:12,280 --> 00:19:13,940
这地方真漂亮
Oh, this place is beautiful!

558
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:17,001
那是我们的车 该走了
That's our bus! Time to go!

559
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:19,240
你是什么意思
What do you mean?

560
00:19:19,240 --> 00:19:21,460
-这些人是谁 -这个人是谁
- Who are these guys? - Who's this guy?

561
00:19:22,500 --> 00:19:25,020
亲爱的 真对不起
Honey, I am so sorry.

562
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:26,900
从现在开始 我只属于你
From now on, I am all yours.

563
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:28,882
我发誓 不管你想干什么都行
I promise -- whatever you want to do.

564
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,840
菲尔 我当初想的可不是这个
Phil, this is not what I had in mind.

565
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:35,240
你做得很好 亲爱的
You're doing great, honey.

566
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,460
什么叫做桥梁
What is a bridge?

567
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:39,063
它是一条纽带 一座支架
It's a connecter, a supporter,

568
00:19:39,343 --> 00:19:41,175
而有时候 它象征着爱
and sometimes, it's a metaphor for the love --

569
00:19:41,175 --> 00:19:43,208
-我的天 闭嘴 - 拜托
- Oh, my gosh! Stop!! - Come on!

570
00:19:49,635 --> 00:19:53,270
你们好 我们在大堡礁
Hello, from the Great Barrier Reef!

571
00:20:01,229 --> 00:20:02,841
简直棒极了
That was awesome!

572
00:20:21,893 --> 00:20:22,914
爽
Yes!

573
00:20:38,352 --> 00:20:40,715
感谢您选择乘坐澳洲航空
Thank you for choosing to fly Qantas

574
00:20:40,755 --> 00:20:44,860
由澳大利亚直飞洛杉矶的航班
on our nonstop flight from Australia to Los Angeles.

575
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:48,140
抛开家人坐在这里让我有些愧疚
I feel a little guilty sitting up here without the family.

576
00:20:48,320 --> 00:20:49,400
-我不觉得 -我也是
- I don't. - Me, either.

577
00:20:52,480 --> 00:20:54,080
你不觉得这样有些过分吗
Don't you think it's a little rude

578
00:20:54,080 --> 00:20:55,100
他们竟然坐在前面
that they're sitting up there?

579
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:56,160
我永远都不会那么做
I would never do that.

580
00:20:56,414 --> 00:20:58,896
你度完假马上就恢复紧张状态了
Boy, you tense up fast after a vacation.

581
00:20:59,557 --> 00:21:01,337
我发誓我看到休·杰克曼在前面
I swear, that's Hugh Jackman up there.

582
00:21:01,540 --> 00:21:02,780
我们登机时我看到他了
I saw him when we boarded.

583
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:03,800
我觉得那个不是他
I don't think it's him.

584
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:05,620
好吧 我要去查个清楚
Oh, well, I'm gonna go find out.

585
00:21:05,620 --> 00:21:07,200
小卡 不要 小卡 拜托
Cam, no. Cam, come on.

586
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:09,720
让他去吧 要不我们谁都甭想睡
Let him go, or none of us will get any sleep.

587
00:21:14,600 --> 00:21:16,660
伙计们 我过来打个招呼
Hey, guys. Just saying hi.

588
00:21:17,685 --> 00:21:18,342
不好意思
'scuse me.

589
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:20,400
我觉得这个人不是头等舱的
I don't think he belongs up here.
